OL,3,AUK net migration drops to lowest level
OL,4,Asince 1997 as number of people claiming
OL,5,Aasylum also falls
OL,6,
OL,7,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood says the
OL,8,Fgovernment has "restored control" by
OL,9,Fgetting net migration "down 92% from
OL,10,Fits peak under the previous government"
OL,12,FBut shadow home secretary Chris Philp
OL,13,Fargues the fall is "mainly a result of
OL,14,Fchanges made" by the Tories. He also
OL,15,Fsuggests people are leaving the UK "in
OL,16,Ftheir droves because of Labour's high
OL,17,Ftaxes" - BBC Verify looks into this
OL,18,Fclaim
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
